The Coway AP-1512HH Mighty Air Purifier uses HEPA, carbon, and ion technologies to remove up to 99.97% of pollutants from the air. It covers up to 486 sq. ft. and includes features such as automatic sensor shutdown, HEPA filter protection, and a UV light sanitizer—ideal for users seeking advanced and long-lasting air cleaning performance.
The Vornado Platinum Air Purifier features five cleaning modes, a silent run cycle, and covers up to 938 sq. ft. It's equipped with a True HEPA filter and carbon filter to capture pollen, particles, and volatile organic compounds, and includes a remote control for easy operation.
The GermGuardian AC4860B Ultimate Air Purifier is a portable model ideal for small rooms up to 120 sq. ft. It includes a 3-stage filtration system with pre- and post-filters, UV-C light technology, and Smart Sensing mode for enhanced air quality detection. It's also ENERGY STAR and tested to capture 99.97% of particles ≤0.3 microns.
